    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is happening?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your first day - new job, new life. You originally applied for the night guard position, but now they're making you do things you'd usually hire a janitor for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to clean the park, they said. It'll be fun, they said.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can this thing even shoot?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come across the only shop with the lights still on at this time of night. Approaching, a quirky older lady greets you. She tells you to 'stay safe' and hands you... a weapon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Those aren't toys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you found the generator, things have gone downhill - the noise attracts... <i>beings,</i> toys that look like they have been abandoned and came back to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is neither a job for a night guard, nor a janitor, and certainly not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you keep up your work ethic despite not being paid enough to deal with this?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Nightshift, you will...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go against different types of enemies, wave after wave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of fun weapons with their own special abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is happening?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your first day - new job, new life. You originally applied for the night guard position, but now they're making you do things you'd usually hire a janitor for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to clean the park, they said. It'll be fun, they said.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can this thing even shoot?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come across the only shop with the lights still on at this time of night. Approaching, a quirky older lady greets you. She tells you to 'stay safe' and hands you... a weapon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Those aren't toys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you found the generator, things have gone downhill - the noise attracts... <i>beings,</i> toys that look like they have been abandoned and came back to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is neither a job for a night guard, nor a janitor, and certainly not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you keep up your work ethic despite not being paid enough to deal with this?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Nightshift, you will...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go against different types of enemies, wave after wave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of fun weapons with their own special abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An arcade shooter in an amusement park: defeat enemies one wave after the other to keep the park clean of unwanted visitors. Unlock a variety of different weapons; upgrading them unlocks their special abilities. This is your first shift - will you be able to keep the park's rides safe?",
